Base model.
  The LoRA adapters in this repository are fine-tuned from Qwen3.5-4B
  (Hugging Face: Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B), developed by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud.
  The base model weights are not redistributed here; use of the base model
  and of any model derived from it with these adapters is subject to the
  base model's own license terms.

Model-generated data.
  The SFT data, the preference pairs (chosen and rejected completions), the
  evaluation prompts, and related control texts were generated with OpenAI
  models (gpt-4o-mini; gpt-4o for router label adjudication) through the
  OpenAI API. Use of these outputs is also subject to OpenAI's terms.

SEC filings.
  Filing text used to generate the chosen completions was retrieved from
  the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission's EDGAR system. EDGAR filings
  are public records; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
  the SEC.
